      "id": "curated-a7ed8036f2",
      "question": "How do I renew my Flex bundle?",
      "category": "english_faq",
      "language": "en",
      "answer": "You can renew your Flex bundle through the Ana Vodafone app on the Flex Management page or by dialing *880# [1]. You can pay using Vodafone Cash to get 30% extra flexes, or through direct payment, your balance, or electronic vouchers [1]. If you renew on time or before the renewal date, your remaining flexes will roll over to your next bundle [1].\n\nYou cannot renew your Flex bundle if you have a borrowing amount from \"3al nota\" services [4].\n\nThere is also a \"Renew Now, Pay Later\" service for new Flex bundles, allowing you to renew without additional fees and pay within 3 days. If payment is not made within 3 days, the bundle will be paused until payment [3].",
